  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14190078/assets/96b7c8e8f6d1203327271f4960bde8804315f0f4ac6846beeb4a248af8b07b1a.png)\n\nUsing the graphical method, find the solutions $(x,y)$ of the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}y=x-1 \\\\ y={x}^{2}-3\\end{aligned}\n$$",
